    "body": "I think the docs pretty clearly state that this is non-normative, i.e. not something you should ever use to implement anything.\r\n\r\nThe table case looks fine? The DOM output of http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=10354 (with end `</p>` tag) and of http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=10355 (without) seems to be the same.",
